                <rubric>Examples</rubric>
                <doctest_block classes="doctest" xml:space="preserve">&gt;&gt;&gt; from hydra_zen import builds, make_config, to_yaml</doctest_block>
                <paragraph><strong>Basic usage</strong></paragraph>
                <paragraph>The yaml of a config with both an un-configured field
                    and a configured field:</paragraph>
                <doctest_block classes="doctest" xml:space="preserve">&gt;&gt;&gt; c1 = make_config("a", b=1)
&gt;&gt;&gt; print(to_yaml(c1))
a: ???
b: 1</doctest_block>
                <paragraph>The yaml of a targeted config:</paragraph>
                <doctest_block classes="doctest" xml:space="preserve">&gt;&gt;&gt; c2 = builds(dict, y=10)
&gt;&gt;&gt; print(to_yaml(c2))
_target_: builtins.dict
'y': 10</doctest_block>
                <paragraph>hydra-zen’s additional supported types can be specified as well</paragraph>
                <doctest_block classes="doctest" xml:space="preserve">&gt;&gt;&gt; print(to_yaml(1+2j))
real: 1.0
imag: 2.0
_target_: builtins.complex</doctest_block>
                <paragraph><strong>Specifying resolve</strong></paragraph>
                <paragraph>The following is a config with interpolated fields.</paragraph>
                <doctest_block classes="doctest" xml:space="preserve">&gt;&gt;&gt; c3 = make_config(a=builds(dict, b="${c}"), c=1)</doctest_block>
                <doctest_block classes="doctest" xml:space="preserve">&gt;&gt;&gt; print(to_yaml(c3, resolve=False))
a:
  _target_: builtins.dict
  b: ${c}
c: 1</doctest_block>
                <doctest_block classes="doctest" xml:space="preserve">&gt;&gt;&gt; print(to_yaml(c3, resolve=True))
a:
  _target_: builtins.dict
  b: 1
c: 1</doctest_block>
                <paragraph><strong>Specifying sort_keys</strong></paragraph>
                <doctest_block classes="doctest" xml:space="preserve">&gt;&gt;&gt; c4 = make_config("b", "a")  # field order: b then a</doctest_block>
                <doctest_block classes="doctest" xml:space="preserve">&gt;&gt;&gt; print(to_yaml(c4, sort_keys=False))
b: ???
a: ???</doctest_block>
                <doctest_block classes="doctest" xml:space="preserve">&gt;&gt;&gt; print(to_yaml(c4, sort_keys=True))
a: ???
b: ???</doctest_block>
